%%textfont Helvetica 10
%%begintext
Palmer's Square, version 1

This tune was composed by Tomas Limpan, of Storis & Limpan Band, in 2017 or so.
It was notated from a recording shown on Facebook at that time.  Limpan gave us permission
to use it, but it did not yet have a title, so it's simply called "Limpan's Tune" here.

%%endtext
