%%textfont Helvetica 10
%%begintext
Per the Clarke Tin Whistle book by Bill Ochs, tune composer Norman Maclean is a piper from Uist in the Outer Hebrides. 
"A friend of his working in London complained about the qulaity of potatoes there, and so this tune was born".
%%endtext
% Source: sources/harbormist-com/tunes1/abc.zip/abc/Scarce_O_Tatties.txt.abc

